symmetrically.  Vertically oriented red lines are drawn through the triangl=
e, seemingly highlighting a specific path or subset of numbers within the s=
tructure.  These lines do not appear to follow a consistent pattern based o=
n the visible portion of the triangle, suggesting a selection rather than a=
 mathematical relationship.  No URLs or parameters are present." loading=3D=
"lazy" width=3D"234" height=3D"168" decoding=3D"async" data-nimg=3D"1" styl=
