re>
<p>Now that we=E2=80=99ve simplified the triangle, it=E2=80=99ll be easier =
to identify patterns in the positions of the first even number in each row.=
 Let=E2=80=99s explore this further.</p>
<p><strong>Identifying patterns</strong><br>
<!-- -->Let's ignore rows 1 and 2 since even numbers only begin appearing f=
rom row 3 onward. A good place to start looking for a pattern is to highlig=
ht the first even number at each row and observe their positions:</p>
<figure class=3D"py-1"><div style=3D"display:flex;justify-content:center"><=
